# Workers Static Assets exclusions for the staging web Worker
# (wrangler.web-staging.toml). Production Pages never serves the
# functions/ directory as static files (it is the Functions source), and
# web-staging/ is this Worker's own source, so both are excluded from the
# asset upload to match production behavior. The Worker bundle imports
# functions/_renderer.mjs at build time; excluding the directory from
# assets does not affect the bundle.
functions/
web-staging/
